      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku hizo Afilisti akusanya majeshi gao ili apigane viha na Iziraeli. Akishi achimuambira Daudi, “Nalonda umanye kukala uwe na atuo mundadziunga na jeshi rangu huphiyeni vihani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi naye achimjibu achiamba, “Uchivyogomba ni sawa kabisa nawe undadzionera mwenye vira mtumishio anavyoweza kuhenda.” Akishi achimuamba Daudi, “Ichikala unaweza kuhenda vivyo phahi ndakuhenda mrindzi wangu wakati wosi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
